# Axebane Ferox: "Ward-Collect evidence 4." (CR 702.21a, 701.59a) Bot2 first fills its graveyard with two Lightning Strikes (mana
# value 2 each) cast at Bot1, then casts two Lightning Bolts at the Ferox on turn 2. The first: Bot2 declines the ward cost, so
# that Bolt is countered and the Ferox (4/4) is untouched, and Bot2's graveyard (two Lightning Strikes and the Bolt, total 5) is as
# it was. The second: Bot2 accepts, and the cards it exiles must have total mana value 4 or greater - a Bolt and a Lightning Strike
# (3) are refused, two Lightning Strikes (exactly 4) are exiled - and the Bolt is not countered: its 3 damage is marked on the Ferox.

